ts, then the number of pivot columns in $P$ is \n\n$$\n9-4=5.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{rank}(P)=5.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186547289 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6929a8b5-b7b1-567a-9625-d3ce9d1278c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547276} {:answer/id #uuid "6ecc155a-bd5b-59b9-b455-76a973fc37f1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547277} {:answer/id #uuid "a8756575-dd43-56bd-aba0-a6044b4c46e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547281} {:answer/id #uuid "c3a801ec-a20c-5582-ac56-e68c5c961237" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547283} {:answer/id #uuid "d4f43e9b-bb9d-5a9e-ae82-d7675a08bf36" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547286}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547276} :answer-field/id #uuid "bd7030d8-080b-55de-b01a-844c33e12134" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547282}] :question/id #uuid "ed8ba18a-6f66-543b-bfae-4f1da3ae9419" :question/problem "Let $A$ be a $12\\times 7$ matrix that has $1$ **pivot** column. What is the rank of the matrix?" :question/worked-solution "We know that $\\text{rank}(A)$ is the number of pivot columns in $A.$ \n\nSince we are told that $A$ has $1$ pivot column, we have \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)=1.\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Rank of a Matrix Given the Number of Pivot Columns"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119848 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119662 :question/id #uuid "a6a3db41-6033-537a-bc9d-03fde02dc869" :question/math-academy-id "e-5417" :question/problem "Which of the following matrices have a rank of $4?$\n\n![](images/2c/2cd43e61d4c51ee86d78217688d