em "If $D=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,$ then $\\text{rank}(D)=$" :question/worked-solution "To find the rank of $D,$ we first reduce it to row echelon form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe reduced matrix has $3$ pivot columns (or alternatively, it has exactly $3$ non-zero rows).\n\nTherefore, $\\text{rank}(D)=3.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186425057 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65028e55-3a8b-521e-8771-7d7fd0667387" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186425023} {:answer/id #uuid "66b70f53-aa24-525d-8ce3-88738f313f32" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186425024} {:answer/id #uuid "a818e102-2e5b-547e-9d5e-908647988fcb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186425033} {:answer/id #uuid "aa1f3aad-6a31-57d1-aef1-e79d1174936a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186425034} {:answer/id #uuid "d6825204-482f-5521-8bda-c88be8485051" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186425042}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186425023} :answer-field/id #uuid "875bc03a-5e72-5af8-9376-22adf38e16a5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186425052}] :question/id #uuid "6e4ed9e5-eccc-52bc-8945-b31db9b251e2" :question/math-academy-id "q-35285" :question/problem "If \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -6 & -9 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 6 & 2\\en